==Battleground==
*4 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Trolly Blogger]] spawns as the boss.
**40 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**12 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**7 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Ange Lackey]] spawns after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>.
**2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Ackey]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**1 [[Hackey]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is rather simple. Since Ragin' Gory is the only hard pusher on the stage, using [[Ancient Egg: N112 (Rare Cat)|Cat Egg Pod]] will provide amazing stalling due to its 50% chance to dodge behemoth enemies. Use [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to quickly kill the Ragin' Gory and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] to clear peons. After all peons are cleared just time your [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] so he enters the seahorses' blind spot without being hit and all the seahorses should die quickly and your victory will be assured.

